    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0456" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/2230</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of War</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dern</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-23">April 23, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Referring to previous
                    correspondence in reference to limitations being placed on work which was
                    requested <pb facs="0457" n="387" xml:id="pg387"/> of The Panama Canal to be
                    done on the Peruvian Cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Bolognesi</hi>, and
                    particularly to my letter of April 17th quoting the Governor’s radiogram of the
                    12th instant advising, among other things, that this cruiser arrived on the 10th
                    instant, there is quoted hereunder the following self-explanatory radio received
                    from the Governor under date of the 21st instant: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Confidential—Peruvian Cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Bolognesi</hi>
                            sailed from Balboa yesterday afternoon. Understand going to Callao.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>The above quoted message was read to a representative of the State Department
                    over the telephone on the 21st instant.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. H. Dern</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
